# DC01 – Windows Server Configuration

## Overview

DC01 is the Windows Server 2022 virtual machine used as the
primary server for my Windows Server Home Lab.

The server is hosted in VMware Workstation and uses my home
PLDT Wi-Fi connection through VMware NAT networking.

## Server Configuration

| Setting | Value |
|---|---|
| Server Name | DC01 |
| Operating System | Windows Server 2022 Standard Evaluation |
| Edition | Desktop Experience |
| RAM | 8 GB |
| Storage | 80 GB |
| Virtualization | VMware Workstation |
| Network | VMware NAT |

## Purpose

DC01 will provide centralized Windows Server services for the
home lab, including:

- Active Directory Domain Services
- DNS
- User and computer management
- Group Policy
- Domain authentication
